MSG_SAFETY_PROBLEM_RANGE_FROM_ZERO=Out of range (a whole number from 0 up to the ceiling of the server): {field}
MSG_SAFETY_PROBLEM_MODEL=A row has no model name.
MSG_SAFETY_PROBLEM_DUPLICATE=The model is already in the table: {field}
