MSG_ACCESS_CLAIM_OTHER_ACCOUNT={what} refused: the robot is reserved by another account. {detail}
MSG_ACCESS_CLAIM_OTHER_CONTROLLER={what} refused: the robot is reserved by your account from another window or device. Use that one, or release the reservation there. {detail}
MSG_ACCESS_CLAIM_CONTROLLER_REQUIRED={what} refused: the reservation names a controller and this request named none. {detail}
MSG_ACCESS_JOG_NOT_ARMED={what} refused: the jog is not armed. Arm it first. {detail}
