MSG_NET_REJ_OTHER_ACCOUNT={what} rejected: the robot is reserved by another account ({detail})
MSG_NET_REJ_OTHER_CONTROLLER={what} rejected: the robot is reserved by your account from another window or device ({detail})
MSG_NET_REJ_CONTROLLER_REQUIRED={what} rejected: the reservation names a controller and this request named none ({detail})
MSG_NET_REJ_NOT_ARMED={what} rejected: the jog is not armed - arm it first in Robot Control ({detail})
MSG_NET_SIM_BLOCKED=The {command} command for robot {robot} was not sent: the robot is in Sim mode. Switch it to Live to move or change the real robot.
MSG_NET_LISTEN_ONLY_BLOCKED=The {command} command for robot {robot} was not sent: the program is in listen-only mode. Turn it off to send commands.
MSG_NET_JOG_LIMIT=Jog refused: the step is above the limit of {limit} set by the server for this model. Nothing was sent.
MSG_NET_TEMP_LOWERED=The server lowered the bed target ({requested} -> {applied} °C) to the limit of this model.
LBL_REMEMBER_SERVER=Remember this server
LBL_REMEMBERED=Remembered
HINT_REMEMBER_SECURE=On by default. A remembered server keeps its address and user name in the configuration file; its password goes to the secure store of this computer, never to the file.
HINT_REMEMBER_NO_STORE=This computer has no secure store: a remembered server keeps its address and user name, but the password is not kept and is asked for again.
MSG_CREDENTIALS_NOT_STORED=The password could not be stored in the secure store of this computer; it will be asked for again next time.
