TOTP_COPY=Copy key
TOTP_COPIED=Key copied.
TOTP_CODE=Code shown by the app (6 digits)
TOTP_CONFIRM=Confirm and turn on
TOTP_RECOVERY_TITLE=Recovery codes
TOTP_RECOVERY_HINT=Keep them somewhere safe. Each one works once if you lose the phone. They are not shown again.
TOTP_RECOVERY_SAVED=I have saved them
TOTP_TURN_OFF_CODE=Current code or an unused recovery code
TOTP_TURN_OFF=Turn off
TOTP_DONE_ON=Two-step sign-in is on.
