LBL_SECURITY_NODEHEALTH_ENABLED=Let operators and administrators read the last health frame of each controller board (GET /api/node-health)
LBL_SECURITY_NODEHEALTH_HELP=Off by default: the route then answers as if it did not exist. When on, the server asks the SPI bridge of the CM5, which needs its option and a brain built with the health query. Read only: nothing is sent to the boards.
